is: The hypothesis holds for one of the two departures it names. The node should say: the four-word id probably reached the kernel through the folder and its miniature; of their departures from NUMS.Go only the type taken from the category is found in the old runtime, whose composites carry package 0 and the category's level.
why: Line 59 of the axioms file carries the four words and no field meaning. The old runtime builds a composite id as fk_nid_make(0, the category's level, the category's type, a running index) (runtime/fkwu-uni.c lines 16495 and 16974; node 3.4.2.3). Type from the category agrees with mini-nums (core.py line 183) against NUMS.Go's 0; package 0 for composites is not 'package 1 everywhere'; the category's level is neither NUMS.Go's nor mini-nums's tree height.
